msgid ""
"Master identity details used by AI agents to automatically determine Debit "
"vs. Credit, invoice directions, and ledger accounts."
msgstr ""
"Datos maestros de identidad utilizados por los agentes de IA para determinar"
" automáticamente Débito vs. Crédito, dirección de facturas y cuentas "
"contables."

msgid "How AI Determines Debit vs. Credit Using Your Profile"
msgstr ""
"Cómo determina la IA Débito vs. Crédito usando el perfil de su empresa"

msgid ""
"When processing scanned paperwork or receipts, the AI agent compares the "
"document against your company's name and tax identifiers to eliminate "
"accounting ambiguity:"
msgstr ""
"Al procesar documentos escaneados o recibos, el agente de IA compara el "
"documento con el nombre e identificación fiscal de su empresa para eliminar "
"ambigüedades:"

msgid "Our Company is the Buyer (Billed To)"
msgstr "Nuestra empresa es el comprador (Facturado a)"

msgid ""
"Classified as <strong>Vendor Bill (Payable)</strong>. Ledger effect: "
"<strong>Debit</strong> = Expense/Inventory, <strong>Credit</strong> = "
"Accounts Payable."
msgstr ""
"Clasificado como <strong>Factura de proveedor (Por pagar)</strong>. Efecto "
"contable: <strong>Débito</strong> = Gasto/Inventario, "
"<strong>Crédito</strong> = Cuentas por pagar."

msgid "Our Company is the Seller (Billed From)"
msgstr "Nuestra empresa es el vendedor (Facturado por)"

msgid ""
"Classified as <strong>Customer Invoice (Receivable)</strong>. Ledger effect:"
" <strong>Debit</strong> = Accounts Receivable, <strong>Credit</strong> = "
"Sales Revenue."
msgstr ""
"Clasificado como <strong>Factura de cliente (Por cobrar)</strong>. Efecto "
"contable: <strong>Débito</strong> = Cuentas por cobrar, "
"<strong>Crédito</strong> = Ingresos por ventas."

